sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant SDK as TrainerClient<br/>(kubeflow-sdk)
    participant Backend as KubernetesBackend
    participant K8sClient as kubernetes<br/>Python Client
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>TLS (kubeconfig/SA)
    participant CM as ConfigMap<br/>kubeflow-trainer-public
    participant CRD as Custom Resources<br/>(TrainJob / Katib / SparkConnect)

    Note over SDK,Backend: Initialization Phase

    User->>SDK: TrainerClient()
    SDK->>Backend: KubernetesBackend()
    Backend->>K8sClient: load_kube_config()<br/>or load_incluster_config()
    K8sClient-->>Backend: ApiClient configured

    Backend->>K8sAPI: GET ConfigMap<br/>kubeflow-system/kubeflow-trainer-public
    K8sAPI-->>Backend: ConfigMap data<br/>(control plane version check)
    Note over Backend: Non-blocking version<br/>compatibility check

    Note over SDK,CRD: Training Workload Creation

    User->>SDK: client.train(model, dataset, ...)
    SDK->>Backend: create_train_job(spec)
    Backend->>Backend: Serialize Pydantic models<br/>to K8s API payload
    Backend->>K8sAPI: POST CustomObjectsApi<br/>trainjobs.kubeflow.org
    K8sAPI->>CRD: Create TrainJob CR
    K8sAPI-->>Backend: TrainJob created (201)
    Backend-->>SDK: Job reference
    SDK-->>User: Training job submitted

    Note over SDK,CRD: Status Monitoring

    User->>SDK: client.get_job_status(name)
    SDK->>Backend: get_train_job(name)
    Backend->>K8sAPI: GET CustomObjectsApi<br/>trainjobs.kubeflow.org/{name}
    K8sAPI-->>Backend: TrainJob status
    Backend-->>SDK: Parsed status
    SDK-->>User: Job status (Running/Succeeded/Failed)

    Note over SDK,CRD: Katib Hyperparameter Tuning (Optional)

    User->>SDK: client.tune(objective, params, ...)
    SDK->>Backend: create_katib_experiment(spec)
    Backend->>K8sAPI: POST CustomObjectsApi<br/>experiments.kubeflow.org
    K8sAPI->>CRD: Create Experiment CR
    K8sAPI-->>Backend: Experiment created (201)
    Backend-->>SDK: Experiment reference
    SDK-->>User: Tuning experiment submitted
